### DAHITI Database
Water level time series from virtual stations.

- Format: Water level time series can be downloaded in ASCII, NetCDF, CSV, and JSON formats  
- Content: Time series of water level derived from multi-mission altimetry  
- Source: DAHITI database (DGFI-TUM)  
- Access here: [DAHITI Portal](https://dahiti.dgfi.tum.de/en/map/)
